    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn scrap into fortune and build your junk empire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left with nothing but debt, you take over your grandfather\u2019s old scrapyard. The place is falling apart, but it\u2019s your only chance to start fresh. With rusty machines and a pile of junk, you must collect scrap, dismantle old items, and create valuable materials to sell at the second-hand shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival won\u2019t be easy\u2014you must manage hunger and thirst while expanding your business. Earn money to upgrade your scrapyard with <strong>new production stations, bigger storage spaces, and better vehicles</strong> to transport more scrap. Take risks by buying abandoned warehouses\u2014you never know what treasures (or junk) you might find inside!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Can You Do?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Collect &amp; Dismantle Scrap:</strong> Gather abandoned metals, machines, and old appliances, then break them down for useful materials.<br>\ud83d\ude9b <strong>Drive &amp; Transport:</strong> Upgrade your vehicles to carry more scrap and boost efficiency.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Sell &amp; Earn Money:</strong> Process materials and sell them at the second-hand shop for profit.<br>\ud83c\udf7d <strong>Survive &amp; Manage Needs:</strong> Keep an eye on your hunger and thirst\u2014you need money to stay alive!<br>\ud83c\udfed <strong>Expand Your Business:</strong> Unlock new production stations, storage areas, and machines.<br>\ud83c\udfda <strong>Buy &amp; Explore Warehouses:</strong> Take a gamble by purchasing warehouses filled with unknown items\u2014will you strike gold or just find more junk?<br>\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Process &amp; Upgrade Scrap:</strong> Convert raw materials into high-value products for bigger profits.<br>\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Explore &amp; Find Hidden Treasures:</strong> Roam the town and discover new scrap sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becoming a successful scrap dealer isn\u2019t easy. <strong>Work hard, upgrade your business, pay off your debts, and turn junk into gold!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Collect scrap, grow your business, survive, and build your scrapyard empire!</strong></p>",
